  "raw": " Batman hair, in self-defense because he didn't expect a target picture this perfect to be available to him within half an hour.\n\n'I had one horrible fight with #whowouldwin two months ago...couldn't believe he still put up with me?' His question got quickly answered: 'Yeah! You buddy!' Marlon suddenly spoke out for the first time since meeting Random, in self defense nowadays too.\"If I gave my word,\" Despite warning him that no one could say Yes as long as it wasn't a lie, he wouldn't have expected such strong objections against the formation of their team, aside from Barbara always being against their alliance whenever it was warranted.\n\nAfter all, she has her team while he doesn't. Such riddles which posed actual non-negotiables waned into pure jokes as largely depicted by them all met a resounding defeat on Random's part once his initial effort to yell at random strangers in public failed enough times to have",
